{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/87086e7273e3655fa6fc35d90b82cbe5.poster.avif?t=1752221908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/87086e7273e3655fa6fc35d90b82cbe5.webm?t=1752221908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/87086e7273e3655fa6fc35d90b82cbe5.mp4?t=1752221908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MEET ARINA &amp; FRENDT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two decades after their childhood adventures, Frendt discovers Arina's diary while moving house. Through its pages, their  friendship comes alive once again in Hidden Memories of The Gardens Between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/0cb90aa6312175cb61fb58f67126db87.poster.avif?t=1752221908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/0cb90aa6312175cb61fb58f67126db87.webm?t=1752221908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/0cb90aa6312175cb61fb58f67126db87.mp4?t=1752221908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WHAT'S NEW IN HIDDEN MEMORIES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twice the content of the original game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40 new VR-exclusive puzzles integrated throughout the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully remastered visuals optimized for virtual reality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the narrative through Arina's perspective via her illustrated diary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Physically interactive puzzle elements unique to VR gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/0c04e432950d649948fe946c0d8cdfa5.poster.avif?t=1752221908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/0c04e432950d649948fe946c0d8cdfa5.webm?t=1752221908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/0c04e432950d649948fe946c0d8cdfa5.mp4?t=1752221908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate time and objects in surreal, memory-filled environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage with tactile VR interactions - from crafting friendship bracelets to wielding paintbrushes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate dreamlike islands filled with mementos from pivotal friendship moments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/169c18c0fc5392fe3c581727248ff787.poster.avif?t=1752221908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/169c18c0fc5392fe3c581727248ff787.webm?t=1752221908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/169c18c0fc5392fe3c581727248ff787.mp4?t=1752221908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NARRATIVE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the story through Arina's diary entries and artistic e